					"googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25vMFlsZ3daRkJNWjNaQlZIVTJjbWc1TVVkbVFsRRAB!2m1!1s0x89c2595dac7b2b6d:0x2ed2aeb3c57e72ae"
				},
				{
					"name": "places/ChIJbSt7rF1ZwokRrnJ-xbOu0i4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aYWQzUkpOMnRLWDJacE1VUmtjRGxOV2pOMWQyYxAB",
					"relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
					"rating": 2,
					"text": {
						"text": "Great vibes but the pizza disappointed. The vodka slice was low on sauce with a cheese that didn't melt. The specialty ndjua slice was bitter and imbalanced. And the pepperoni roll was very doughy and chewy and cold. It's a local spot but unfortunately all three pieces were disappointing.",
						"languageCode": "en"
					},
					"originalText": {
