					"relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
					"rating": 4,
					"text": {
						"text": "been seeing the silly tiktoks & i was hungry in the neighborhood so i decided to stop by. really good food, i'll definitely be back!! the employees were also super nice! there are only 3 tables so don't expect to be able to dine in. as a ranch connoisseur & midwesterner, i approve of this ranch. the crust becomes inedible after reheating, i wouldn't recommend buying extra for leftovers unless you wanna reheat it in the stove.",
						"languageCode": "en"
					},
